    {
      "id": "fibocom-mtk",
      "title": "Fibocom FM350 / RW350 (MediaTek)",
      "source": "docs/modem-zoo/modems/fibocom-fm350.md; AT-REFERENCE.md (fibocom); AT+CFUN=15 as the reboot: a vendor router's operator list (HANDOFF 170), F28",
      "match": [
